<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>She Soars | Your Right To Soar</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

:root {
  --burgundy: #8B3A4A;
  --dusty-rose: #C4909A;
  --blush: #E8C8CC;
  --cream: #FAF6F4;
  --warm-white: #FFFCFB;
  --dark: #2C1A1E;
  --mid: #6B4048;
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif; background: var(--warm-white); color: var(--dark); overflow-x: hidden; }

/* NAV */
nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
  padding: 20px 40px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  background: rgba(255,252,251,0.92);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(139,58,74,0.08);
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}
.nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; }
.nav-logo img { width: 28px; height: 28px; object-fit: contain; }
.nav-logo-text { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--burgundy); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
.nav-links a { text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--mid); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: color 0.2s; }
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--burgundy); }
.nav-cta { background: var(--burgundy) !important; color: white !important; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 500 !important; transition: background 0.2s !important; }
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--mid) !important; }
.nav-toggle { display: none; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
.nav-toggle span { width: 22px; height: 2px; background: var(--burgundy); border-radius: 2px; }

/* HERO */
.hero { min-height: 100vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; padding-top: 80px; overflow: hidden; }
.hero-left { padding: 80px 60px 80px 80px; }
.hero-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dusty-rose); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.hero-headline { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: clamp(52px, 5.5vw, 80px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.08; color: var(--burgundy); margin-bottom: 28px; }
.hero-headline em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; }
.hero-sub { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--mid); max-width: 400px; margin-bottom: 44px; font-weight: 300; }
.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
.btn-primary { display: inline-block; background: var(--burgundy); color: white; padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.04em; transition: all 0.25s; }
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--mid); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(139,58,74,0.25); }
.btn-ghost { display: inline-block; color: var(--burgundy); padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.04em; border: 1.5px solid var(--blush); transition: all 0.25s; }
.btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--blush); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.hero-right { height: 100vh; position: relative; background: var(--blush); overflow: hidden; }
.hero-right img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; opacity: 0.88; }
.hero-right-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(139,58,74,0.15) 0%, rgba(139,58,74,0.35) 100%); }
.hero-float-card { position: absolute; bottom: 48px; left: 36px; background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 22px 28px; box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(44,26,30,0.18); width: 220px; }
.hero-float-card .card-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--dusty-rose); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.hero-float-card .pillars-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.hero-float-card .pillar-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.hero-float-card .pillar-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
.hero-float-card .pillar-word { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }

/* SECTIONS */
section { padding: 100px 80px; }
.section-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dusty-rose); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.section-title { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 3.5vw, 52px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.15; color: var(--burgundy); }
.section-title em { font-style: italic; }

/* STORY */
.story { background: var(--cream); }
.story-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
.story-image-wrap { position: relative; }
.story-image-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 520px; object-fit: cover; object-position: top center; border-radius: 120px 20px 120px 20px; display: block; }
.story-image-tag { position: absolute; bottom: 40px; right: 0; background: var(--burgundy); color: white; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 160px; }
.story-body { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--mid); font-weight: 300; margin-top: 28px; }
.story-body + .story-body { margin-top: 16px; }
.story-signature { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 22px; font-style: italic; color: var(--burgundy); margin-top: 32px; display: block; }

/* PILLARS */
.pillars { background: var(--warm-white); text-align: center; }
.pillars-title-wrap { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 64px; }
.pillars-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2px; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; }
.pillar-card { padding: 56px 44px; transition: filter 0.25s; cursor: default; }
.pillar-card:nth-child(1) { background: var(--blush); }
.pillar-card:nth-child(2) { background: var(--dusty-rose); }
.pillar-card:nth-child(3) { background: var(--burgundy); }
.pillar-card:hover { filter: brightness(1.04); }
.pillar-number { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.pillar-card:nth-child(1) .pillar-number { color: rgba(139,58,74,0.18); }
.pillar-card:nth-child(2) .pillar-number,
.pillar-card:nth-child(3) .pillar-number { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
.pillar-name { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.pillar-card:nth-child(1) .pillar-name { color: var(--dark); }
.pillar-card:nth-child(2) .pillar-name,
.pillar-card:nth-child(3) .pillar-name { color: white; }
.pillar-desc { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; font-weight: 300; }
.pillar-card:nth-child(1) .pillar-desc { color: var(--mid); }
.pillar-card:nth-child(2) .pillar-desc,
.pillar-card:nth-child(3) .pillar-desc { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); }

/* EVENT */
.event-section { background: var(--burgundy); color: white; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.event-section::before { content: "SOAR"; position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 200px; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); letter-spacing: -0.05em; pointer-events: none; }
.event-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.event-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blush); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.event-title { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: clamp(40px, 4vw, 60px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.1; color: white; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.event-title em { font-style: italic; }
.event-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 420px; }
.event-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
.event-badge { display: inline-block; background: var(--blush); color: var(--burgundy); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 50px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.event-card-title { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400; color: white; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.2; }
.event-details { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 32px; }
.event-details li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); line-height: 1.5; }
.event-details li:last-child { border: none; }
.event-icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.btn-light { display: block; background: white; color: var(--burgundy); padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-align: center; transition: all 0.25s; }
.btn-light:hover { background: var(--blush); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }

/* GALLERY */
.gallery { padding: 100px 80px; background: var(--cream); }
.gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: 240px 240px; gap: 12px; margin-top: 56px; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; }
.gallery-item { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
.gallery-item:first-child { grid-row: 1 / 3; }
.gallery-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.5s ease; display: block; }
.gallery-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
.gallery-quote { background: var(--burgundy); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
.gallery-quote blockquote { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; color: white; line-height: 1.5; }
.gallery-quote cite { display: block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blush); margin-top: 14px; font-style: normal; }
.gallery-instagram { background: var(--blush); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 28px; text-align: center; gap: 6px; }
.gallery-instagram .ig-handle { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; color: var(--burgundy); }
.gallery-instagram .ig-sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--mid); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.gallery-instagram a { display: inline-block; background: var(--burgundy); color: white; padding: 9px 20px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
.gallery-instagram a:hover { background: var(--mid); }

/* TESTIMONIALS */
.testimonials { background: var(--warm-white); text-align: center; }
.testimonials-subtitle { font-size: 15px; color: var(--mid); font-weight: 300; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
.testimonials-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
.testimonial-card { background: var(--cream); border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px 32px; text-align: left; }
.t-stars { color: var(--dusty-rose); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 3px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.testimonial-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--mid); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 28px; font-style: italic; }
.testimonial-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--burgundy); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
.testimonial-role { font-size: 12px; color: var(--dusty-rose); margin-top: 2px; }

/* NEWSLETTER */
.newsletter { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--burgundy) 0%, #6B2030 100%); text-align: center; padding: 100px 80px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.newsletter::after { content: ""; position: absolute; bottom: -100px; right: -100px; width: 400px; height: 400px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); pointer-events: none; }
.newsletter-title { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 300; color: white; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.15; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.newsletter-title em { font-style: italic; }
.newsletter-sub { font-size: 15px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 480px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; line-height: 1.7; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.newsletter-form { display: flex; gap: 12px; max-width: 460px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.newsletter-form input { flex: 1; padding: 16px 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 50px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: white; font-size: 14px; outline: none; font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif; }
.newsletter-form input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
.newsletter-form button { background: white; color: var(--burgundy); border: none; padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif; transition: all 0.25s; }
.newsletter-form button:hover { background: var(--blush); transform: translateY(-1px); }

/* FOOTER */
footer { background: var(--dark); padding: 64px 80px 40px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
.footer-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); margin-bottom: 36px; }
.footer-brand-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.footer-brand-logo img { width: 22px; height: 22px; object-fit: contain; filter: brightness(0) invert(1) opacity(0.7); }
.footer-brand-logo span { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: white; }
.footer-tagline { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 300; }
.footer-social { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
.footer-social a { width: 36px; height: 36px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-decoration: none; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 14px; transition: all 0.2s; }
.footer-social a:hover { background: var(--burgundy); color: white; }
.footer-col-title { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: white; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.footer-links { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.footer-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 300; transition: color 0.2s; }
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--blush); }
.footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; }
.footer-bottom a { color: var(--dusty-rose); text-decoration: none; }

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  section { padding: 72px 32px; }
  nav { padding: 18px 24px; }
  .nav-links { display: none; }
  .nav-toggle { display: flex; }
  .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero-left { padding: 100px 32px 60px; }
  .hero-right { height: 400px; }
  .story-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .story-image-wrap img { height: 360px; }
  .pillars-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  .event-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
  .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto; }
  .gallery-item:first-child { grid-row: auto; }
  .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .newsletter { padding: 72px 32px; }
  .newsletter-form { flex-direction: column; }
  footer { padding: 48px 32px 32px; }
  .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; text-align: center; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav id="nav">
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
    <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="She Soars logo">
    <span class="nav-logo-text">She Soars</span>
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#story">Our Story</a></li>
    <li><a href="#events">Events</a></li>
    <li><a href="#community">Community</a></li>
    <li><a href="mailto:shesoars04@gmail.com">Contact</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://forms.google.com" target="_blank" class="nav-cta">Join Us</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" style="padding: 0;">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Women's Wellness Community &middot; UK</p>
    <h1 class="hero-headline">You Have<br>The Right<br><em>To Soar.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A community helping women become their best selves through movement, connection, and intentional living.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="https://forms.google.com" target="_blank" class="btn-primary">Become a Soarer</a>
      <a href="#events" class="btn-ghost">Our First Event</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Women moving together">
    <div class="hero-right-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-float-card">
      <div class="card-label">Our pillars</div>
      <div class="pillars-row">
        <div class="pillar-item">
          <div class="pillar-dot" style="background:var(--burgundy)"></div>
          <div class="pillar-word">Move</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar-item">
          <div class="pillar-dot" style="background:var(--dusty-rose)"></div>
          <div class="pillar-word">Connect</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar-item">
          <div class="pillar-dot" style="background:var(--blush)"></div>
          <div class="pillar-word">Soar</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STORY -->
<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="story-inner">
    <div class="story-image-wrap">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Emmanuella Animashaun, Founder of She Soars">
      <div class="story-image-tag">Emmanuella Animashaun<br>Founder, She Soars</div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-content">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Born from a belief that <em>movement changes everything.</em></h2>
      <p class="story-body">She Soars was founded by Emmanuella Animashaun, a fitness enthusiast and Corporate Associate at one of the UK's leading health and wellness companies.</p>
      <p class="story-body">After years of watching women pour themselves into careers, businesses, and everyone else's wellbeing, Emmanuella saw a gap. Not another fitness class. A community. A space where women could move, breathe, laugh, and belong.</p>
      <p class="story-body">Every She Soars experience is designed with intention. You will not just work out. You will walk away feeling seen, energised, and more like yourself than you have in a long time.</p>
      <span class="story-signature">Emmanuella Animashaun, Founder</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PILLARS -->
<section class="pillars">
  <div class="pillars-title-wrap">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">What We Do</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Three pillars. <em>One community.</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="pillars-grid">
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-number">I</div>
      <div class="pillar-name">Move</div>
      <p class="pillar-desc">Movement that honours the body and quiets the mind. Walk clubs, pilates, and more. Not for aesthetics, but for how it makes you feel.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-number">II</div>
      <div class="pillar-name">Connect</div>
      <p class="pillar-desc">The friendships you did not know you needed. We create genuine spaces for women to meet, share, and support one another.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-number">III</div>
      <div class="pillar-name">Soar</div>
      <p class="pillar-desc">Grow into the fullest version of yourself. With community around you, the ceiling disappears. This is where you realise your right to soar.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- EVENT -->
<section class="event-section" id="events">
  <div class="event-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="event-eyebrow">Our First Experience</p>
      <h2 class="event-title">It starts <em>on the court.</em></h2>
      <p class="event-body">We are kicking off She Soars with something a little different. Padel tennis, the fastest growing sport in the world, brings all the energy, laughter, and connection we are about. No experience needed. Just show up ready to move and meet your people.</p>
      <a href="https://forms.google.com" target="_blank" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-block;">Reserve Your Spot</a>
    </div>
    <div class="event-card">
      <span class="event-badge">First Event</span>
      <div class="event-card-title">She Soars Padel Morning</div>
      <ul class="event-details">
        <li><div class="event-icon">📅</div><span>Date to be confirmed. Sign up to be first to know.</span></li>
        <li><div class="event-icon">📍</div><span>United Kingdom. Venue details shared on booking.</span></li>
        <li><div class="event-icon">🎾</div><span>Padel tennis. All levels welcome.</span></li>
        <li><div class="event-icon">👯</div><span>Small group. Limited spots available.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <a href="https://forms.google.com" target="_blank" class="btn-light">Secure My Place</a>
    </div>
  </div>
